            </note>
            <note corresp="#d596-f2" n="82" xml:id="d596-f2-content">
                <p>See Great Britain, <hi rendition="#italic">Parliamentary Debates</hi>, 5th
                    series, vol. 229, pp. 411 ff.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d596-f3" n="83" xml:id="d596-f3-content">
                <p>See treaty of commerce signed at Vienna on October 19, 1925; League of Nations
                    Treaty Series, vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">lv</hi>. p. 9.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
